# Brilliance Unleashed, "Choose one or both" (CR 700.2): both modes, in the order printed (CR 608.2c). Mode 1 deals 5 damage to Bot2's Wall of Stone (0/8, so it lives and shows the 5); mode 2
# returns Bot1's Black Lotus, sacrificed on turn 1 and a noncreature artifact card, to the battlefield as a 3/3 Robot artifact creature with flying (CR 614.12, 205.1a, 613.4b): its Artifact type
# stays, it is a creature from the moment it enters, and it keeps its own abilities.

